    "summary": "The user asks for a summary of the news regarding the impact of the Supreme Court's Dobbs decision. After initially providing a somewhat vague/incorrect legal update, the assistant eventually describes the \"vibe\" of the news. When the user pushes the assistant to acknowledge the \"civil rights setback\" framing, the assistant agrees and adds a partisan commentary regarding the campaign motivations of political figures.",
